{"id":3218,"slug":"3218-slots-la-gi-named-slots-va-scoped-slots","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Component Communication","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Slots là gì? Named slots và scoped slots?","question_en":"What are slots? Named slots and scoped slots?","answer_vi":"Slots cho phép parent inject content vào template của child component. Default slot: `<slot />`. Named slots: `<slot name=\"header\" />` — parent dùng `<template #header>`. Scoped slot: child truyền data lên parent qua slot:\n```vue\n<!-- Child -->\n<slot :item=\"item\" :index=\"i\" />\n\n<!-- Parent -->\n<template #default=\"{ item, index }\">\n  <span>{{ index }}: {{ item.name }}</span>\n</template>\n```\nDùng scoped slots khi child biết cách lấy data nhưng parent quyết định cách render (render prop pattern). Lưu ý: không mix slot và v-if trên cùng `<template>` — tách riêng.","answer_en":"Slots let a parent inject content into a child component's template. Default slot: `<slot />`. Named slots: `<slot name=\"header\" />` — parent uses `<template #header>`. Scoped slot: child passes data up to parent through slot:\n```vue\n<!-- Child -->\n<slot :item=\"item\" :index=\"i\" />\n\n<!-- Parent -->\n<template #default=\"{ item, index }\">\n  <span>{{ index }}: {{ item.name }}</span>\n</template>\n```\nUse scoped slots when child knows how to get data but parent decides how to render it (render prop pattern).","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Slots cho phép parent inject content vào template của child component.</p><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li>Default slot: <code>&lt;slot /&gt;</code>.</li><li>Named slots: <code>&lt;slot name=\"header\" /&gt;</code> — parent dùng <code>&lt;template #header&gt;</code>.</li><li>Scoped slot: child truyền data lên parent qua slot:</li></ul><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Child --&gt;\n&lt;slot :item=&quot;item&quot; :index=&quot;i&quot; /&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- Parent --&gt;\n&lt;template #default=&quot;{ item, index }&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;span&gt;{{ index }}: {{ item.name }}&lt;/span&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Child --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">slot</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:item</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;item&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:index</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Parent --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span> #<span class=\"hljs-attr\">default</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;{ item, index }&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>{{ index }}: {{ item.name }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng scoped slots khi child biết cách lấy data nhưng parent quyết định cách render (render prop pattern).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Lưu ý: không mix slot và v-if trên cùng <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> — tách riêng.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Slots let a parent inject content into a child component's template.</p><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li>Default slot: <code>&lt;slot /&gt;</code>.</li><li>Named slots: <code>&lt;slot name=\"header\" /&gt;</code> — parent uses <code>&lt;template #header&gt;</code>.</li><li>Scoped slot: child passes data up to parent through slot:</li></ul><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Child --&gt;\n&lt;slot :item=&quot;item&quot; :index=&quot;i&quot; /&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- Parent --&gt;\n&lt;template #default=&quot;{ item, index }&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;span&gt;{{ index }}: {{ item.name }}&lt;/span&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Child --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">slot</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:item</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;item&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">:index</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Parent --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span> #<span class=\"hljs-attr\">default</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;{ item, index }&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>{{ index }}: {{ item.name }}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Use scoped slots when child knows how to get data but parent decides how to render it (render prop pattern).</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3217-cac-cach-truyen-data-giua-components-trong-vue","title":"Các cách truyền data giữa components trong Vue?"},{"url":"/q/3219-defineexpose-trong-script-setup-la-gi","title":"`defineExpose` trong `<script setup>` là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3205-cac-directive-pho-bien-trong-vue-v-if-v-show-v-for-v-model-v-bind-v-on","title":"Các directive phổ biến trong Vue: v-if, v-show, v-for, v-model, v-bind, v-on?"},{"url":"/q/3206-v-if-vs-v-show-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"v-if vs v-show — khi nào dùng cái nào?"}]}